title: Nutanix Prism: Cluster Storage (API v4)
agents: nutanix
catalog: virtual/nutanix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the physical storage capacity and usage of the whole
 Nutanix cluster (all disks of all nodes). The usage includes the replicas
 created by the redundancy factor. The levels can be configured with the
 rule "Filesystems (used space and growth)". The logical usage is shown as
 additional information.

 This check requires the Nutanix Prism special agent for API v4 (agent_prism_v4).

item:
 Always "Cluster".

discovery:
 One service is created for the cluster.
